{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fortpost</strong> \u2013 A tactical shooter with base defense in a 5x5 km open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Present day. A former military specialist, after years of dangerous service, decides to return home and find a quiet place to rest and figure out what to do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guarding a remote, soon-to-be-decommissioned military base in the desert seemed like the perfect job for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But, as always, something went wrong: first, unsettling questions arose about the place, and then events rapidly unfolded\u2014the kind you\u2019d only expect to see in sci-fi movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435_\u0438\u0433\u0440\u044b1.jpg?t=1744870457\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hunt down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Stop them from breaking through your territory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Explore facilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Search for weapons and ammo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Upgrade your vehicle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Monitor damage and fuel indicators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Figure out what\u2019s really going on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 And most importantly\u2014buy time until the army arrives<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435_\u0438\u0433\u0440\u044b2.jpg?t=1744870457\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No traditional base \u2013 The entire map serves as a buffer zone to defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on mobility \u2013 Dynamic movement over static defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical layer \u2013 Slow enemy advances and control their routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource-driven progression \u2013 Loot is essential to continue, repair, and upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicle as a mobile base \u2013 Weapons, fast travel, and storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global consequences \u2013 Enemy breakthroughs impact the story and game world</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669270?t=1744870457","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/105ad2a19bfeffad8d32c48dd2be164a64a977f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744870457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/7cc5cb670da3a321ad2156f30440ed749c65fd90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744870457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/7cc5cb670da3a321ad2156f30440ed749c65fd90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744870457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fortpost</strong> \u2013 A tactical shooter with base defense in a 5x5 km open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Present day. A former military specialist, after years of dangerous service, decides to return home and find a quiet place to rest and figure out what to do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guarding a remote, soon-to-be-decommissioned military base in the desert seemed like the perfect job for that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But, as always, something went wrong: first, unsettling questions arose about the place, and then events rapidly unfolded\u2014the kind you\u2019d only expect to see in sci-fi movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435_\u0438\u0433\u0440\u044b1.jpg?t=1744870457\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hunt down enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Stop them from breaking through your territory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Explore facilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Search for weapons and ammo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Upgrade your vehicle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Monitor damage and fuel indicators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Figure out what\u2019s really going on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 And most importantly\u2014buy time until the army arrives<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/extras/\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435_\u0438\u0433\u0440\u044b2.jpg?t=1744870457\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No traditional base \u2013 The entire map serves as a buffer zone to defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on mobility \u2013 Dynamic movement over static defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical layer \u2013 Slow enemy advances and control their routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource-driven progression \u2013 Loot is essential to continue, repair, and upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicle as a mobile base \u2013 Weapons, fast travel, and storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global consequences \u2013 Enemy breakthroughs impact the story and game world</p>","developers":["NIKULIN GAME STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669270/5c385620b5a14f6ff2dc4d780b6f5afb4779d8cb/header.jpg?t=1744870457","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127095,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra